Constraints.Constraint:
Archives under `.ngrace/changes/archive/` and `docs/plans/archive/` are never
edited. decisions.md is not amended — F21/F22 remain the authority's record;
this bundle cites and closes them.

NonGoals.NonGoal:
Closed vocabulary or schema validation of FailureSignature kind/key values
beyond non-empty existing requirements. Signature honesty stays agent-authored;
Trigger D bounds the damage when keys vary.

VerificationIntent.ExpectedEvidence:
Sequence matrix both triggers: fail(A)×2 escalates R; fail(A),fail(B) no;
fail(A),fail(B),fail(C) no; fail(A),fail(B),fail(C),fail(D) escalates D;
fail(A),fail(B),fail(A) escalates R not D; fail(A),pass,fail(B) no;
fail(A),pass,fail(A) R; pass,fail no; VU×2 no; window after reason-resume
resets both counters; message names correct trigger; resume without reason
on escalated task refuses with no event and set uncleared; reason round-trips
through fold; ordinary resume without reason still works; skill prose states
R=2 same-signature and D=4 distinct (not bare two failed attempts); commit
body names both thresholds + resume reason; validate-marketplace green
(mirror identical, version surfaces untouched and still in sync at 6.1.1);
token-accounting pin re-measured if skill lines change; ngrace lint --path .
0/0; ngrace review --path . 0 findings; validate:ci green.
